  "description": "OCPP 1.6J (JSON over WebSocket) central system for EV chargers, hosted inside any ASP.NET Core app: accepts charge point connections, answers the Core profile (BootNotification, Heartbeat, StatusNotification, Authorize, Start/StopTransaction, MeterValues, DataTransfer) through a host handler, and sends remote commands (RemoteStart/StopTransaction, Reset, UnlockConnector, ChangeAvailability, TriggerMessage, Get/ChangeConfiguration). Lenient towards real-life firmware (odd timestamps, kWh/Wh units, numbers as strings). Includes a charge point client used by the tests and the simulator. No dependency on FAS.",
